# The pve_cpi binary is invoked on demand by the BOSH director via stdin/stdout
# JSON-RPC — it is not a long-running process. A `check process` declaration
# would cause monit to restart it continuously. This no-op check program keeps
# monit satisfied while leaving the invocation model intact.
check program pve_cpi with path /bin/true
  if status != 0 then unmonitor
